  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TASAF - Productive Social Safety Net (PSSN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A national social safety net (cash transfers, public works and livelihoods interventions) to improve access to income-earning opportunities and socio-economic services for targeted poor households while enhancing and protecting the human capital of their children.</narrative>
  </description>
